  "title": "Week 51: Pets 🐶",
  "date": "2024-12-27T22:00:00.000Z",
  "content": "Week 51: Pets 🐶\n\nThis week I was mostly on pet duty for my friend’s dog and cat.\nNot gonna lie, it’s not the easiest job 😅.\n\nlucky\n\nMorning & night dog walks 🚶‍♂️🐕\n\nA cat that’s super alive at night 🌙🐈 (he even knows how to open doors!)\n\nResult: me = barely any good sleep 😴\n\nBut hey, they’re just being animals, can’t really blame them ❤️.\n\nOn the brighter side, I also watched an animation called Secret Level 🎬🎮.\nIt’s a series inspired by game ideas. I went through the first 10 episodes — and honestly, pretty good stuff! 👍✨",
